        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "McQuinn Property are delighted to offer for sale this excellent circa 0.44-acre (0.18ha) site, ideally located in the heart of Kilmoyley, Co. Kerry, just approximately 5 minutes from Banna Beach.\r\n\r\nThe site offers an excellent opportunity for those seeking to build a home in a peaceful rural village setting, while remaining within easy reach of the coast and the surrounding amenities.\r\n\r\nThe site is being offered subject to obtaining full planning permission.\r\n\r\nProperty Specifications\r\n-Circa 0.44-acre site\r\n-Excellent location in the heart of Kilmoyley\r\n-Approximately 5 minutes from Banna Beach\r\n-Available subject to full planning permission\r\n-Existing neighbouring properties comprise a mix of dormer-style houses and bungalows\r\n\r\nDirections:\r\n\r\nFrom Ardfert Village, continue past the turn-off for Banna Beach in the direction of Ballyheigue. Continue until you see the signpost for Kilmoyley and turn right. Proceed towards Kilmoyley and, upon reaching the church, turn left. Continue along this road and the site is located on the right-hand side, identified by the McQuinn Property For Sale sign.\r\n\r\nAn excellent opportunity to acquire a well-located residential site within easy reach of Banna Beach, Ardfert and Ballyheigue.\r\n\r\nFor further information please contact the Sole Selling Agents McQuinn Property Services. \r\n\r\n*While every effort has been made in accurately assembling the information no responsibility will be accepted by this firm for omissions or inaccuracies and we urge you to seek professional advice before entering into binding agreements."
      },
